%% A report is checked before it is stored. Langfuse judges the stored text after.
sequenceDiagram
  participant Edge
  participant Agent as IncidentService
  participant Guard as GuardedWriter
  participant Gemini as Writer model
  participant LF as Langfuse
  participant Judge as Judge model

  Edge->>Agent: POST /api/incidents (snapshot)
  Agent->>Guard: writeReport(snapshot)
  Guard->>Gemini: prompt from Langfuse, or the hardcoded rules
  Gemini-->>Guard: report text and token counts
  alt a number is not in the snapshot
    Guard->>Gemini: same prompt, one retry
    Gemini-->>Guard: second report
    Guard->>Guard: still bad, use the local writer
  end
  Guard-->>Agent: report that passed, or the local report
  Agent->>Agent: store the row
  Agent->>LF: generation, with tokens and the prompt version
  LF->>Judge: snapshot against the stored report
  Judge-->>LF: snapshot_faithful
